I go into the waiting room.
The room is very quiet.
Three other patients are already sitting here.
They sniffle quietly, because they are also sick.
I sit down on a free chair.
I take a magazine from the table.
I try to read the magazine.
But I cannot concentrate at all.
My head hurts extremely.
My throat is dry and my ears hurt too.
I put the magazine back on the table.
I know I should just rest now.
I lean back in my chair.
I close my eyes and breathe slowly.
Hopefully the doctor calls my name soon.
I just want to go back to my warm bed.
